@startuml activity_confirm_reservation
title Activity — Confirm reservation (UC8)
|Admin|
start
:Open all reservations;
:Click Confirm on reservation;
|System|
:Re-check availability (UC4a) against CONFIRMED reservations;
if (slot free?) then (yes)
  :Set reservation state -> CONFIRMED;
  |NotificationService|
  :send_confirmation(reservation, user);
  stop
else (no)
  :Return 409 Conflict;
  stop
endif

note right
  The re-check prevents race conditions where another reservation
  was confirmed between DRAFT creation and admin approval.
end note

@enduml
@startuml activity-confirm-reservation
skinparam backgroundColor white

|Admin|
start
:Open "All reservations";
:Click "Confirm" on a\nDRAFT reservation;

|System|
if (Reservation still DRAFT?) then (yes)
  if (Car still available for\nthat time range?) then (yes)
    :Set status to CONFIRMED;
    :Send confirmation notification\n(log, or e-mail if SMTP is\nconfigured — NotificationService);
    :Prepare success result;
  else (no)
    :Prepare "slot taken in the\nmeantime" error (409);
  endif
else (no)
  :Prepare "not a pending\nrequest" error (409);
endif

|Admin|
:See result\n(confirmed, or error message);
stop
@enduml
